
                Aluminum 6061-T6 Specification

                Chemical Composition:
                - Aluminum: 95.8-98.6%
                - Magnesium: 0.8-1.2%
                - Silicon: 0.4-0.8%
                - Chromium: 0.04-0.35%

                Mechanical Properties:
                - Yield Strength: 276 MPa (40 ksi) minimum
                - Tensile Strength: 310 MPa (45 ksi) minimum
                - Elongation: 12% minimum
                - Hardness: 95 HB minimum

                Applications:
                - Aircraft structures
                - Automotive parts
                - Marine applications
                - General engineering
                